{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/979b39f4fbfea1ebba117ddf53b2bbb9.avif?t=1760957630\" width=616 height=1280 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the battlefield with Warside, a modern iteration on the classic turn-based-tactics formula. Experience an <strong>epic story mode campaign</strong>. Choose between <strong>legendary Commanders</strong>, each with unique playstyles and devastating <strong>Battle Powers</strong>. Master the battlefield with a vast array of terrain and units. All brought to life with <strong>beautiful pixel art</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Commander, assemble your forces, and battle your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 30 Unit Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storm the battlefield with <strong>tanks</strong> and <strong>artillery</strong>. Master the seas with  <strong>submarines</strong> and  <strong>warships</strong>. Conquer the skies with <strong>helicopters</strong> and <strong>jet aircraft</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/dc952dd5891e5e6eb680dd0fd82e004a.poster.avif?t=1760957630\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/dc952dd5891e5e6eb680dd0fd82e004a.mp4?t=1760957630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a variety of specialist infantry, including <strong>snipers</strong>, <strong>medics</strong>, <strong>mortar teams</strong>, and <strong>saboteurs</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >14 Playable Commanders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 14 Commanders, each with <strong>unique passive skills</strong> and game-changing <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/71df0bd840ba0cb4d81773e129144ab5.poster.avif?t=1760957630\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/71df0bd840ba0cb4d81773e129144ab5.webm?t=1760957630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/71df0bd840ba0cb4d81773e129144ab5.mp4?t=1760957630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Powers can be devastating, but they need careful timing to have the most impact. Choose wisely for maximum effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in our epic single-player campaign with <strong>over 30 missions</strong> to master. Classic battles, plus escort, rescue, and covert missions with jaw-dropping story events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/292509f54f65e324db78bca2968a9684.avif?t=1760957630\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in beautifully drawn <strong>forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong>, and <strong>ice</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and enemies to thrilling <strong>multiplayer</strong> battles in <strong>online play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/9b5e9294d2afd86d6d786683628e6851.avif?t=1760957630\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive <strong>turn-based gameplay</strong> with a familiar feel for fans of the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 playable Commanders</strong>, each with unique <strong>passive skills</strong> and <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>30+ unit types</strong>. Simultaneously battle over land, air, and sea with <strong>ground forces</strong>, <strong>aircraft</strong>, and <strong>naval units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction unique units</strong> with mechanics specific to each faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign</strong> with over 30 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong> and <strong>snow</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and foes with <strong>multiplayer battles</strong>. Local and internet play are supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own maps with the <strong>built-in mission editor</strong> for both single and multiplayer.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Not a Scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/bc77eb457a044619e891674add8331436708e58c.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Forward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/7fd75cb74c4a0193344ac8da2572d6d6b681e524.jpg"},{"name":"Uninvited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/aa8adde26a500a4de5f979bf33939aeaed55d1a2.jpg"},{"name":"Fragile Package","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/c74ca5f8fd9d54bd04ab1c04f47af59c47235132.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/fa1703466071ea059f4c1d7ec94a805f8e3b9e10.jpg"},{"name":"Swimming Lessons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/6e6643f7661237e5b42343efde2318f28ba6486f.jpg"},{"name":"Checkmate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/b3a92a4716e17567e3b7561c5acb5c0c6d609cac.jpg"},{"name":"The New World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/beb6e3e06c1615b2e0d3eefd8a0e7c92f29b5596.jpg"},{"name":"What's an Airport Again?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/ffac23d766a9b4c47846b623d65a72c05c1f3e61.jpg"},{"name":"Tanks a Lot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368300/94653522d5310514617da50161476f72ff2b975f.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2368300?t=1760957630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/c2e44f84c06378cd86bd29b7da1496067630d394/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760957630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/b99da9dc07af49c098cdd624efd419292d49e6b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760957630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/b99da9dc07af49c098cdd624efd419292d49e6b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760957630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":