scue, and covert missions with jaw-dropping story events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/292509f54f65e324db78bca2968a9684.avif?t=1760957630\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in beautifully drawn <strong>forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong>, and <strong>ice</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and enemies to thrilling <strong>multiplayer</strong> battles in <strong>online play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/9b5e9294d2afd86d6d786683628e6851.avif?t=1760957630\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive <strong>turn-based gameplay</strong> with a familiar feel for fans of the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 playable Commanders</strong>, each with unique <strong>passive skills</strong> and <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>30+ unit types</strong>. Simultaneously battle over land, air, and sea with <strong>ground forces</strong>, <strong>aircraft</strong>, and <strong>naval units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction unique units</strong> with mechanics specific to each faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player campaign</strong> with over 30 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong> and <strong>snow</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and foes with <strong>multiplayer battles</strong>. Local and internet play are supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own maps with the <strong>built-in mission editor</strong> for both single and multiplayer.</p></li></ul>","developers":["LAVABIRD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/d3ca48b32d06d648a009f1ba8ac458410ae7f124/header.jpg?t=1760957630","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 LAVABIRD Ltd 2022.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or equivalent (6th Gen)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible video card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or equivalent (9th Gen)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible video card</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2368300/867648/16d43d0f9e81a55f35ac25e33b308e9c4d90695a/1750813150/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744637477","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2368300/867648/16d43d0f9e81a55f35ac25e33b308e9c4d90695a/1750813150/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744637477","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2368300/8